    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carver gets betrayed by his organization which leads to his death, but the need for revenge won't let him die tonight. In the afterlife, with radio contact from a friend,  they try to get Carver back to the land of the living. You'll have to manage your way back with an extensive arsenal of weapons and explosives, tight gunplay, and light puzzle solving skills. But with fierce AI and wide variety of enemies around every corner will you survive this suspense filled night before you  'JackKnife' or get derailed?Features: Goal oriented AI, Full screen support, Save/load function, Upgrade system, Graphics/performance options, Full voice acting, and Story.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carver gets betrayed by his organization which leads to his death, but the need for revenge won't let him die tonight. In the afterlife, with radio contact from a friend,  they try to get Carver back to the land of the living. You'll have to manage your way back with an extensive arsenal of weapons and explosives, tight gunplay, and light puzzle solving skills. But with fierce AI and wide variety of enemies around every corner will you survive this suspense filled night before you  'JackKnife' or get derailed?Features: Goal oriented AI, Full screen support, Save/load function, Upgrade system, Graphics/performance options, Full voice acting, and Story.</p>",
    "short_description": "First Person Shooter with surreal gunfights and story. Tactical Goal Oriented Ai. Many enemy types and bosses. Merchant with upgrade system. Fully Voice Acted Story. Gibbing enemies. Interactable and destructible environments.",
